{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>張敬軒即將於澳門倫敦人舉行跨年演唱會，未料昨日優先訂票即引發15萬人塞爆系統搶購。原本1,780元套票更被瘋狂 …</p><p></p>\n<p>張敬軒即將於澳門倫敦人舉行跨年演唱會，未料昨日優先訂票即引發15萬人塞爆系統搶購。原本1,780元套票更被瘋狂炒高至1.5萬天價，讓大批忠實歌迷苦不堪言。一票難求加上黃牛猖獗情況，逼使主辦方必須緊急採取驚人舉動。\n</p>\n<h2>張敬軒澳門騷15萬人排隊搶飛</h2>\n<p>昨日歌迷會內部預購率先展開，網絡售票系統史無前例錄得接近15萬名會員同時排隊輪候，原定6場演出瞬間爆滿。今日轉戰公開發售階段，搶飛熱潮再度急速升溫，8場門票全數遭到秒殺。市場上隨即湧現大量疑似黃牛黨放售門票，將原價1,780元套票惡意抬高至1.5萬元出售，若以單張票價計算炒價足足飆升4至5倍。</p>\n<h2>澳門倫敦人主辦方兩日兩度加場</h2>\n<p>面對一票難求與黃牛肆虐情況，主辦單位火速調整策略應對龐大購票需求。團隊昨日率先加開12月27日及明年1月3日兩場演出，今日見勢頭未減再落實加開1月9日及10日兩場，短短兩日間將總場次由最初6場大幅增至10場。新增場次門票將於明日率先開放予歌迷會優先認購，下星期再作公開發售，務求讓樂迷能以正價入場。\n</p>\n<h2>盛樂演唱會歌迷掀起瘋狂搶購潮</h2>\n<p>這場《澳門倫敦人榮譽呈獻：張敬軒 x 澳門中樂團 Unplugged．盛樂演唱會》屬於聖誕節及元旦黃金檔期，向來是各大歌手必爭之地，加上長假期效應自然吸引大量外地粉絲提早預備行程。過往同類大型跨年演出往往極速售罄，今次舞台更特別結合中樂團元素，獨特編排進一步推高期待值。市場對這類高質素節慶表演需求龐大，造成門票供不應求現象，導致黃牛黨伺機大規模入貨圖利。</p>\n<h2>大批忠實樂迷湧入社交平台吐苦水</h2>\n<p>即使大會已經盡力增加供應，無數向隅歌迷依然滿腔怒火，紛紛湧入各大社交平台留言表達不滿。有網民無奈表示「chok極都chok唔到飛」，亦有人大呻「全部”缺貨登記” 有冇神人買到？」。面對公開發售極速售罄，大批粉絲激動直斥「1分鐘就話冇？？不如直接唔好賣」，同時也有不少擁躉強烈要求「終極加10場, please!!!」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318546852045129_18520323036ae1d6bd291bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"londoner flip 9-10 JAN_1027_1080x1080_8.jpg/4500x4500_q90.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318546852045129_18520323036ae1d6bd291bb.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547627793112_834356166ae1d6c4a29dd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_9174.PNG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547627793112_834356166ae1d6c4a29dd.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：網站截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547938277330_898780096ae1d6c7cb0f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"f4bc99ae-6dc6-4992-9313-f8d4b503e95f.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318547938277330_898780096ae1d6c7cb0f9.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548121083176_13952744966ae1d6c9a7188.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"5293b116-1c78-46ed-9bb7-c1eb1600bdea.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548121083176_13952744966ae1d6c9a7188.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548264540491_8404938646ae1d6cb1346a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"02ac1b3f-685e-4f21-8e77-28eaf0f80602.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318548264540491_8404938646ae1d6cb1346a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%95%ac%e8%bb%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張敬軒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%bc%94%e5%94%b1%e6%9c%83%e9%bb%83%e7%89%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會黃牛</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e5%80%ab%e6%95%a6%e4%ba%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">澳門倫敦人</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531702\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:41.666318+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1246,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:04:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:18:47.806523+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:41.361291+00:00","content_hash":"76c997b286151d7c5cf1ce41e4d7b29cb9b7f50eeac1d22e36d4210ffc2ed99f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}